> GET /proxy?url=http://127.0.0.1:<plain-port>/markdown&follow=1
> Origin: https://test.example.com
> X-Proxy-Token: <token>
> Accept: text/markdown, text/plain;q=0.9, */*;q=0.1

< 200
< Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type, X-Proxy-Token
< Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, HEAD, POST, OPTIONS
< Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://test.example.com
< Access-Control-Allow-Private-Network: true
< Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Content-Length, Content-Type, Date, Vary, X-Upstream-Content-Encoding, X-Upstream-Content-Length, X-Upstream-Final-URL, X-Upstream-IP, X-Upstream-Location, X-Upstream-Protocol, X-Upstream-Redirects, X-Upstream-Timing, X-Upstream-Truncated
< Access-Control-Max-Age: 600
< Content-Length: 25
< Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
< Date: <date>
< Vary: Origin
< Vary: Accept
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Upstream-Content-Length: 25
< X-Upstream-Final-Url: http://127.0.0.1:<plain-port>/markdown
< X-Upstream-Ip: 127.0.0.1
< X-Upstream-Protocol: HTTP/1.1
< X-Upstream-Redirects: 0
< X-Upstream-Timing: dns=<ms>;tcp=<ms>;ssl=<ms>;ttfb=<ms>;total=<ms>

# Golden

Markdown body.
